{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fSolcbey8e1793231123.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達收購Hugging Face的交易，據報遭美國司法部質疑。</p><p></p><p>《路透》報道，美國司法部正就輝達以129.3億美元，收購開源平台Hugging Face的交易進行諮詢，調查有否對人工智能領域造成影響，交易會否令輝達掌控人工智能領域，是一個關鍵分發節點。</p><p></p><p>輝達曾表示收購Hugging Face後，這家公司會繼續支持與一系列晶片、雲端及人工智能供應商的合作，預計交易於明年上半年完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:43.263870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:10.847383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:58:50.420386+00:00","content_hash":"6801fcc67f8b218c6bc86816d474382b7a73361622f587637b85d5dbe24229ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:43.263870+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}